{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYING IN A BOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in the nostalgia of choose-your-own-adventure books! Explore all possibilities and find the secrets and stories hidden within the pages of <strong>Die for a Die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/extras/b7666e540d7d91679f0b6499694c40d8.avif?t=1761666534\" width=600 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DICE POWERED TURN BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice to perform attacks and spells, learn to control chaos  to unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan carefully and adapt to your opponents moves to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/extras/bba31c46be475514723929b2f6c9887a.avif?t=1761666534\" width=603 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER SYNERGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot new unique dice and build your draw bag.\u00a0Combine them with gears and treasures you will find along the way to gain an advantage on your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/extras/76b45a04762fec0028a74ece5738f667.avif?t=1761666534\" width=600 height=369 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NAVIGATE THE REALM OF AMARTIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right path in this chaotic and ever changing world and try to reach Jocus\u2019 palace to have a chance to escape your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/extras/2fef5a0f908694873db9861e8933b6fb.avif?t=1761666534\" width=600 height=485 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107940?t=1761666534","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/cab9e022b27b6fd68c975e9730c9c9bc70319f85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761666534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/94444512b583cf04b7069d3eaa7678da525ac327/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761666534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/94444512b583cf04b7069d3eaa7678da525ac327/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761666534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYING IN A BOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in the nostalgia of choose-your-own-adventure books! Explore all possibilities and find the secrets and stories hidden within the pages of <strong>Die for a Die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/extras/b7666e540d7d91679f0b6499694c40d8.avif?t=1761666534\" width=600 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DICE POWERED TURN BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice to perform attacks and spells, learn to control chaos  to unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan carefully and adapt to your opponents moves to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107940/extras/bba31c46be475514723929b2f6c9887a.avif?t=1761666534\" width=603 height=442 /></span></p><h2 cla